  <item>
    <title>vol.9-我在厦门巷子里当庙公</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6953613714db1df9ef79c23b</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6953613714db1df9ef79c23b</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 30 Dec 2025 05:39:56 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>一只耳 RadioAnEar 子栏目</span><strong><span>「有影喊三声」</span></strong><br><span>本期聊聊</span><strong><span>花现和他「庙公」的新身份</span></strong><span>——</span><br><span> </span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="73">01:13</a> 对「庙公」的理解</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="585">09:45</a> 威震殿和广泽尊王的传说</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1923">32:03</a> 威震殿里的神明陈列和布置</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2313">38:33</a> 接手后的工作和威震殿的日常</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2776">46:16</a> 威震殿与附近社区的公共关系</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3390">56:30</a> 庙宇的新老交替</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3845">64:05</a> 现场Call-in</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fo4eVdFf1c6FjTpwIp_1E3qOOlG9.png"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>威震殿：</span></strong><span>位于思明区天一楼巷1-1号，是厦门老城区唯一祭祀广泽尊王的庙宇，也叫圣王公宫，历史可追溯至清代。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FncDmqRE-ZDkHxgPZY5K-0mdXO--.png"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>广泽尊王：</span></strong><span>本名郭忠福，具有翘右腿、垂左腿的独特形象。广泽尊王生前是五代时期福建安溪，古称崇善里的一位牧童，蜕化成神，之后屡屡显灵，成为南安当地的乡土守护神，其信仰更从南安扩及整个闽南，又随著移民迁徙而传播到台湾、香港和东南亚等地，颇具影响力。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuRTY3y8oPO_nk5vRwferW2UYbRf.png"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>距尻川石：</span></strong><span>威震殿门口的大石头，是小朋友们喜欢的“滑滑梯”，被叫做“距尻川石”。闽南语里“距”就是滑，“尻川”就是屁股，就是“滑屁股的石头” 。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>诗山凤山寺：</span></strong><span>又称郭山庙，泉州南安市诗山镇的坊前村，传说是广泽尊王郭忠福坐化之地。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>漳州当凤宫：</span></strong><span>位于漳州新华东路559号，庙里有一家本地传统特色卤面店。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>三太子：</span></strong><span>托塔天王李靖的第三子，被尊为“太子爷”或中坛元帅。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>虎爷：</span></strong><span>庙宇的守卫神或土地神座下的神兽，被尊称为下坛将军。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>录制现场</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fn0Dl637tkA6aGu-6pXtqc03GmFW.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiTDKtKdhG3aROnzALRn1y1oPGWK.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fk_AvbFLZ7esagpG5w1i-KbgHR3U.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtdJYAuicAYW9c85vvzrhm2d3eco.png"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><strong><span>陈花现</span></strong><span>｜小法、湖里区闽南传统彩绘传承人，热心于闽南民间美术与民俗田野。日常专工民俗风格绘画与视觉应用，亦做与在地民俗相关的自由撰稿。</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span>阿昂</span></strong><span>｜媒体人、策展人，生于厦门。2020年创办啲叻DEALERS杂志（让创造力流通），2022年创立一只耳Art&amp;Books（反派是了解世界的线索）。</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span>一只耳播客间开放计划</span></strong><br><span>播客节目一只耳 RadioAnEar</span><br><span>将不定期以开放录制现场的方式</span><br><span>移动到各式各样的实体空间</span><br><span>欢迎来现场收听</span></p><span></span><blockquote><strong><span>收听方式</span></strong><br><span>网易云音乐、小宇宙、Apple Podcast、Spotify 等</span><br><span>播客平台搜索「一只耳RadioAnEar」</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><strong><span>联系方式</span></strong><br><span>WECHAT：Anear404</span><br><span>E-MAIL：Anear404@163.com</span></blockquote>]]></description>
