  <item>
    <title>vol.8-2024送王船：聊聊闽南人的海洋祭祀</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/670ceaae0d2f24f28903c869</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">670ceaae0d2f24f28903c869</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 14 Oct 2024 09:55:57 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>漳州进发宫2024「送王船」</span><br><span>将与</span><strong><span>10月15日（新历）</span></strong><span>举办</span><br><span>我们抓紧录制了送王船专题</span><br><span>给朋友们提供一个参与的小攻略</span><br><span> </span><br><span>这也是一只耳播客间开放计划</span><br><span>第一次出外景</span><br><span>我们去到了</span><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzU3Mzg3MzM4MQ==&amp;mid=2247487185&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=6e69ba0fe47c26a8fc005e5286b94575&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzU3Mzg3MzM4MQ==&amp;mid=2247487185&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=6e69ba0fe47c26a8fc005e5286b94575&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect"><strong><span>漳州门口muinn-khau</span></strong></a><br><span>它离「进发宫」步行距离可到</span><br><span>参与「送王船」的朋友们</span><br><span>也欢迎去漳州门口muinn-khau玩哦！</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lmrNAXuWO5aMtg_TffK73OlBgVsp.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="46">00:46</a> 门口muinn-khau的介绍</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="194">03:14</a> 「送王船」的缘起，及社会功能的演变</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="609">10:09</a> &nbsp;「送王船」非遗申请和花现当时的经历</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="945">15:45</a> 目前有哪里地方有「送王船」的民俗</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1091">18:11</a> 「进发宫」的「送王船」独特之处</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1339">22:19</a> 「送王船」的准备和流程</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2240">37:20</a> 各自参与/参观「送王船」的经历和体验</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3018">50:18</a> 「进发宫」送王船的时间预告和注意事项</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3249">54:09</a> 现场Call-in</span><br><span> </span><br><span>顺便贴贴去年「送王船」的打卡照</span><br><span>活动非常有意思</span><br><span>期待今年现场可以见到听友！</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lnRZpcnSmavE8YDInlz3HIlAB28w.JPG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lpOC93yLw04V5GnDsuHzDa2tUc1g.gif"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fs4Frve62kbN-zxeMJIiFtNdxzDW.JPG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Ftv-oZwDR1wzIsL38Mu955Ip-_fe.gif"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>陈花现｜小法、湖里区闽南传统彩绘传承人，热心于闽南民间美术与民俗田野。日常专工民俗风格绘画与视觉应用，亦做与在地民俗相关的自由撰稿。</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>阿昂｜媒体人、策展人，啲叻 DEALERS 杂志创办人及主编，一只耳 Art&amp;Books 创办人。</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>大爱｜来自漳州云霄县。《城关阿志》和门口muinn-khau发起人，喜欢在进发宫的江岸边发呆。</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span>一只耳播客间开放计划</span></strong><br><span> </span><br><span>我们将自有场地「一只耳Art&amp;Books」</span><br><span>及设备（调音台、麦克风、音响等）</span><br><span>提供给播客创作者们免费使用</span><br><span>并通过现场听众招募</span><br><span>鼓励在场交流和串门录制</span></p><span></span><p><span>同时，我们孵化的播客节目</span><br><span>一只耳RadioAnEar</span><br><span>也以开放录制现场的方式</span><br><span>游走到各式各样的实体空间</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎咨询录制</span><br><span>欢迎现场收听</span></p><span></span><blockquote><strong><span>收听方式</span></strong><br><span>网易云音乐、小宇宙、Apple Podcast、Spotify 等播客平台搜索「一只耳RadioAnEar」</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><strong><span>联系方式</span></strong><br><span>WECHAT：Anear404</span><br><span>E-MAIL：Anear404@163.com</span></blockquote>]]></description>
