    <title>vol.7-有请土地公</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66ea9b405ca6d0ace3b56570</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66ea9b405ca6d0ace3b56570</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 18 Sep 2024 09:19:59 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>一只耳播客间开放计划首期现场录制</span><br><span>来自一只耳RadioAnEar子栏目</span><br><span>「有影喊三声」vol.07-</span><strong><span>有请土地公</span></strong><br><span>2024.09.05 在一只耳Art&amp;Books顺利录制</span></p><span></span><p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fo1Rk2nKJDzTM2d0CSORIzXeF8s8.jpg"></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnE2zPpEjOINZvFMfPnXAV3u26jK.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmC2VrnsxJIf4qo5E29alj8a-Tt0.gif"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>Vol.07 有请土地公</span></strong><br><span>本期播客缘起于我们的新书店</span><br><span>另一只耳 Art&amp;Books</span><br><span>在退化公园正式开业</span><br><span>并请来了一尊晚清时期的石雕土地公</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>内容涉及：</span></strong><br><span>我们如何寻得的土地公</span><br><span>花现师操持的土地公「开光」仪式</span><br><span>我们平日供养土地公的趣事</span><br><span>闽南的土地公信仰等等</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fp8NjEQt1oNJ88t-BSfhJszfWI1p.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> 播客间开放计划</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="98">01:38</a> 在闽南，做生意的为什么都喜欢拜土地公？</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="301">05:01</a> 福德正神的传说？</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="630">10:30</a> 如何寻得的神像？怎么挑选神像？</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1120">18:40</a> 花现人生第一次拥有神像的经历</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1282">21:22</a> 今年三月份土地公的开光仪式</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2272">37:52</a> 日常怎么供养土地公</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2912">48:32</a> 给想请神明到家里/店里的新人们的建议</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2995">49:55</a> 现场Call-in</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>👇🏻another另一只耳的土地公在退化公园</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fo9AuNmZ57S4uUgCdZnQ3PkB5AbE.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>👇🏻花现主持的土地公开光仪式</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fu5Hi6leDUww0AYdrJvGe7u9bEAY.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fjbc2e7EWXnq9qqVjnN801tGrH9_.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fuu8ltJgtlF2lGZYJ99vpvxtSs2n.jpg"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>陈花现｜小法、湖里区闽南传统彩绘传承人，热心于闽南民间美术与民俗田野。日常专工民俗风格绘画与视觉应用，亦做与在地民俗相关的自由撰稿。</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>阿昂｜媒体人、策展人，生于厦门。2020年创办啲叻DEALERS杂志（让创造力流通），2022年创立一只耳Art&amp;Books（反派是了解世界的线索）。</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span>一只耳播客间开放计划</span></strong><span>欢迎播客创作者们</span><br><span>前来体验录制自己的播客节目</span><br><span>欢迎串门交流，让更多播客见面会发生！</span></p><span></span><blockquote><strong><span>收听方式</span></strong><br><span>网易云音乐、小宇宙、Apple Podcast、Spotify 等播客平台搜索「一只耳RadioAnEar」</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><strong><span>联系方式</span></strong><br><span>WECHAT：Anear404</span><br><span>E-MAIL：Anear404@163.com</span></blockquote>]]></description>
